                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "I watch the low switchbacks so no half-ready climber feeds Ryujin their team at the summit. I saw you the moment you cleared the treeline - up here there is nowhere to not be seen. Warm up on my dragons."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You carry yourself like someone the Keep records used to salute. Do not tell me the story. Tell it to my Bagon."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The storms roll off Ryujin every dusk. Better you meet a dragon on my rock than on the leader's floor."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Arden Drakepath",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
